Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1100
Set Height 600
Output demo/demo.gif

Type "BOT_LANG=en ./target/release/discord-bot chat"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "alice: anyone up?"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Type "bob: i just deployed to prod on a friday"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Type "alice: what do you think about that"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Type "!quit"
Enter
